What changed: the skills, roles, gates, rules, templates and helper scripts
were rewritten to be agent-agnostic. Every skill is a numbered checklist that
works in pi, Codex, Cursor, Claude Code or by hand. The shell and YAML helpers
were replaced by one Python command line (tools/studio.py), and project
settings moved from YAML to TOML.

Provenance: UPSTREAM.toml maps each upstream file to the file that replaces it,
or lists it as ignored together with the reason.

